{"ref":"BDB, מְזוּזָה","hw":"מְזוּזָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. door-post, gate-post</strong>, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:6\" href=\"/Exodus.21.6\">Ex 21:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.8\">Is 57:8</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזַת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.9\">1 S 1:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.2\">Ez 46:2</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.21\">Ez 41:21</a> (del. 𝔖 Co cf. 𝔊 Hi), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.19\">45:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (in both <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזוֹת</span> 𝔊 𝔖 𝔙 Co); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.8\">Ez 43:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזָתָם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.8\">8</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">1 K 6:31</a> + 2 times (+ <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.19\">Ez 45:19</a><sup>(×2)</sup> Co v. supr.), <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:7\" href=\"/Exodus.12.7\">Ex 12:7</a> + 4 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזֻזוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.9\">Dt 6:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">Ju 16:3</a>;—<em>door-post, gate-post</em>,<br><strong>1.</strong>  of dwelling-house <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:7\" href=\"/Exodus.12.7\">Ex 12:7</a> (P), v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:22\" href=\"/Exodus.12.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:23\" href=\"/Exodus.12.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:6\" href=\"/Exodus.21.6\">21:6</a> (all JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 6:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.6.9\">Dt 6:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.20\">11:20</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.8\">Is 57:8</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ פְּתָחָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:34\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.34\">Pr 8:34</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְזוּזָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.8\">Ez 43:8</a>; of Sol.’s house <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.5\">1 K 7:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  of house of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>: <strong>a.</strong>  of the pre-Solomonic sanctuary of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.9\">1 S 1:9</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  of Sol.’s temple <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:33\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.33\">1 K 6:33</a>; of the <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִיר</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.31\">31</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  of Ezek.’s temple <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 41:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.41.21\">Ez 41:21</a> (del. Co v. supr.), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 43:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.43.8\">43:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מְזוּזָתִי)</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ הַבַּיִת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.19\">Ez 45:19</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שַׁעַר</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.19\">19</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.2\">46:2</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  of city-gates <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:3\" href=\"/Judges.16.3\">Ju 16:3</a>.","next":"BDB, יָזִיז","prev":"BDB, זָזָא"}